<section class="section section-tight" id="process"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">How Admissions Work</div><h2 class="section-title">A Simple, Transparent Process.</h2><div class="process-row"><div class="step"><span class="step-num">01</span><b>Enquire</b><p>Share your details and the school of interest.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">02</span><b>Application</b><p>Complete the admission application form.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">03</span><b>Interaction</b><p>Attend the interaction or assessment (where applicable).</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">04</span><b>Submit Documents</b><p>Provide the required documents and information.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">05</span><b>Confirmation</b><p>Complete the formalities to secure admission.</p></div></div><div class="info-grid" id="documents"><article class="info-card"><div class="eyebrow">Documents Required</div><h3>Keep These Ready.</h3><div class="checklist"><span>Birth certificate</span><span>Recent photographs</span><span>Address proof</span><span>Parent/Guardian ID proof</span><span>Previous school report card (where applicable)</span><span>Transfer certificate (where applicable)</span></div><a class="text-link" href="#documents" style="margin-top:16px">View Complete Document List</a></article><article class="info-card"><span class="bus">▣</span><div class="eyebrow">Transport Routes</div><h3>Check Transport Routes<br/>for Your Location.</h3><p class="section-sub" style="font-size:11px">Search the current 2026–27 route directory by campus, locality, society or stop name.</p><a class="text-link" href="/transport" style="margin-top:18px">Open Transport Route Finder →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-tight" id="faqs"><div class="container"><div class="section-head-row"><div><div class="eyebrow">Admissions FAQs</div><h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:0">Questions Parents Often Ask.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="#faqs">View All FAQs</a></div><div class="faq-grid"><div class="faq-item"><button><span>When do admissions open?</span><span>+</span></button><div class="answer">Admissions for the 2026–27 academic year are now open, subject to availability at each campus and grade.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>Can I apply to more than one Lexicon school?</span><span>+</span></button><div class="answer">Yes. Families may explore and apply to the campus that best fits location, availability and individual requirements.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>Which grades are currently accepting applications?</span><span>+</span></button><div class="answer">Availability varies by campus and grade. Please enquire for the latest admission status.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>How do I know which school is closest to me?</span><span>+</span></button><div class="answer">Use the school finder above or contact the admissions team for location and transport guidance.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>Is there an entrance test or interaction?</span><span>+</span></button><div class="answer">An age-appropriate interaction or assessment may be part of the process depending on the grade applied for.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button><span>What documents do I need to apply?</span><span>+</span></button><div class="answer">Typical documents include birth proof, photographs, address and parent ID proof, and previous school records where applicable.</div></div></div></div></section>
